ext","block_id":"aFS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d0243ea-d95b-441b-89fe-48c831b15a68","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"確かにむちゃんんこ長い文字列を使ったら g++ は文字化けして表示されました。","ts":"1634909560.016300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f7b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5adc53a2-ccd2-4d2c-b88d-5b9b21cdaa89","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"ご説明ありがとうございます！\nなんしか、`auto a = std::string(\"ABC\").c_str()` みたいなことはしちゃダメで、どう動くかはコンパイラに依るってことなんですね。","ts":"1634909324.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UqK6h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"159837e6-4ed9-423b-88d1-f27105f58629","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁ UB には違いない。","ts":"1634908944.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gC/EL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea1721c1-0728-478f-84e8-5e862597c448","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"g++ の方は small string optimizer という機能によって、表示してる a がリテラルそのものを示す場合があるらしい。","ts":"1634908939.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f+96"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dee108c-312c-474b-98b7-6e39accb94f7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"たまたま動いてるだけですねぇ…","ts":"1634908388.012000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAWKd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"663003ed-45f3-492c-8a3c-c552db021859","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"g++で動く方が、謎があるよね。まぁメモリの掃除してないってだけかもしれない。","ts":"1634908336.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ybYLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ef416b6-93f4-41a2-85e6-9a9c07b7fd64","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"未定義動作になるのでどちらのコンパイラが吐くコードも正しい。ものによっては警告が出そう","ts":"1634908309.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VpT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b69ddc6e-dc5d-46e0-b21b-0e4275348e6d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"OKの方のコードは値がコピーされていて中身のの寿命が延長されたため","ts":"1634908268.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c42c5b7e-2de9-4cde-b5a6-a33f5f5e6880","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これは一時的な値なので呼び出した直後しか有効ではない","ts":"1634908214.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sdJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfbd8bdd-5e5f-4b33-a2e5-dc1065a0baa3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かに。c_strの結果を変数に格納するのは危険です","ts":"1634908196.007800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ul7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc0d94f6-9b1a-4a68-9b65-ee77c1c25543","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、でも g++ でも同じ表示だな。メモリの持ち方が違うんかもね。","ts":"1634908121.007200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6bjQe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53b663cd-2c9c-4b67-b0cd-fd9031226cdf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```#include \u0026lt;iostream\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;string\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;algorithm\u0026gt;\n\nclass Foo {\n  private:\n    const char* s = NULL;\n  public:\n    Foo(const char* s) : s(s) { std::cout \u0026lt;\u0026lt; \"construct\" \u0026lt;\u0026lt; std::endl; };\n    ~Foo() { std::cout \u0026lt;\u0026lt; \"destruct\" \u0026lt;\u0026lt; std::endl; }\n    const char* c_str() { return s; };\n};\n\nint\nmain(int argc, char* argv[]) {\n  auto s = Foo(\"foo\").c_str();\n  std::cout \u0026lt;\u0026lt; s \u0026lt;\u0026lt; std::endl;\n  return 0;\n}```\nこれ実行すると\n```construct\ndestruct\nfoo```\nになるんだけど `std::basic_string` が中で持ってる `const char*` をデストラクタで開放してしまうんでしょうね。","ts":"1634908061.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Rhd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12109335-778e-42a4-9f6e-ac903a8f34df","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"うん。やっぱりデストラクタが先に走る。","ts":"1634908017.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ygbl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d8d8f76-f37e-45e6-a3d4-e1185527b35c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あ、VCか","ts":"1634907947.005000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o20rQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2482cb57-486c-42ec-9557-4b68a2f09330","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`std::string(\"ABC\")` が代入式の後も生きてるかどうかは UB な気がするなぁ。","ts":"1634907778.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U7HFY4HFY","U78UYGX8W"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"68mPB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6894eb2-5fcc-491b-a8bf-3a97faea0ccb","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"自動変数として表示するより先にデストラクタが実行されちゃうんですかね。","ts":"1634907728.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e3m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8193c327-9927-4fe3-a7c6-6c258b41a7a4","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"コンパイルオプションとかいじったら出るようになるのだろうか？","ts":"1634907358.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U5uw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acdbe820-3393-431f-ac61-ac49e579dce1","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"ちなみに、これだとうまくいきます\n```#include \u0026lt;string\u0026gt;\n\nint main() {\n\tauto a = std::string(\"ABC\");\n\tauto b = a.c_str();\n\tstd::puts(b); // ABC が出力される\n}```","ts":"1634907298.003100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IyG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34567f61-fa3d-4a9b-b9bd-0c9c6a72c2ac","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"始めまして、初心者質問で申し訳ないのですが、以下のコードをVC++でビルドしても何も出力されないんです。これってVC++の仕様なんでしょうか?  MSYSのg++だと出力されましたが...。\n```#include \u0026lt;string\u0026gt;\n\nint main() {\n\tauto a = std::string(\"ABC\").c_str();\n\tstd::puts(a); // 空文字が出力される\n}```","ts":"1634907179.002400","edited":{"user":"U78UYGX8W","ts":"1634907318.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D1cD"}]}]
